     5	/// Photo machine capture, ticket 02 — photograph a machine's name plate, and
     6	/// let the user confirm which catalog model it is.
     7	///
     8	/// The sheet **proposes** (D33). It preselects the top hit when the match is
     9	/// strong, shows the alternatives with their scores, and always leaves "none of
    10	/// these" one tap away — because D23 keys history, prefill and PRs on the model
    11	/// UUID, so a wrong model silently accepted splits the user's own history.
    12	struct ScanMachineLabelSheet: View {
